OL,3,ABurnham says he'll ignore 'stuck in the
OL,4,Apast' former PMs after striking UK-EU
OL,5,Adeal
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt the CBI conference in London,
OL,8,Fcabinet minister Louise Haigh says the
OL,9,Fdeal will "bring down the cost of
OL,10,Fbusiness [and] help with the cost of
OL,11,Ffood"
OL,13,FBut the Conservatives say "all we're
OL,14,Fgetting is vibes" as the full details
OL,15,Fare yet to be published - Badenoch will
OL,16,Fbe speaking at the CBI conference soon
